<title>ITALY: Italy's total reserves dip in November.</title>
<headline>Italy's total reserves dip in November.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's total reserves stood at 109.975 trillion lire at end-November, the Italian Exchange Office said in a statement.</p>
<p>The office gave the following data in trillions of lire:</p>
<p>				    Nov 96	Oct 96	Nov 95</p>
<p>    Total reserves	    109.975	114.721	87.237</p>
<p>    Total assets		111.736	116.531	91.517</p>
<p>     (of which in gold)	38.723	 38.723	41.524</p>
<p>    Liabilities		   1.761	  1.810	 4.280</p>
<p>    (of which short-term)     0.225	  0.270	 2.614</p>
</text>
